/T (and calls the service. The main\(\) function parses the --data argument, creates an ExpenseService \(a StorageError at startup is reported and the program exits cleanly\), and runs the menu loop. Inside the loop, every action runs in a try/except that catches ValidationError, NotFoundError and StorageError \(friendly message\), EOFError and KeyboardInterrupt \(clean exit\), and any other Exception \(logged with a traceback\).)
