<<
/Title (and calls the service. The main\(\) function parses the --data argument, creates an ExpenseService \(a StorageError at startup is reported and the program exits cleanly\), and runs the menu loop. Inside the loop, every action runs in a try/except that catches ValidationError, NotFoundError and StorageError \(friendly message\), EOFError and KeyboardInterrupt \(clean exit\), and any other Exception \(logged with a traceback\).)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 938 0 R
/Prev 942 0 R
/Next 953 0 R
>>
endobj
948 0 obj
<<
